{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_188", "type": "agent_message", "text": "I’ve checked move-dialog ordering with multiple albums, canceled moves, repeated moves, and verified destinations through photo paths. Metadata drafts survive rotation, Revert restores the saved title, and clearing the title persists. The capture-date issue has been reported with a second reproduction, though the developer still couldn’t reproduce it. I’m restoring the original photo names and album locations.\n"}}
